236
00:29:41,343 --> 00:29:45,243
言葉 見えてるの僕が
Words, can you see me?

237
00:29:45,543 --> 00:29:50,343
僕のこの声が届いてる？
Can this voice of mine reach you?

238
00:29:50,443 --> 00:30:00,168
Dancer in the dark シルエットすらも透明で きっと無格好けれど
Dancer in the dark, the silhouette is already transparent, surely uncool, but...

239
00:30:00,578 --> 00:30:07,278
シルエットすらも透明で きっと不格好だけれど でも だから叫んで
Even my silhouette is transparent and clumsy, but that's why I shout

240
00:30:08,738 --> 00:30:16,978
足掻いて 裸足のまま走って ねえ 気付いて 教えてよ
and thrash, running barefoot—hey, notice me and tell me:

241
00:30:18,338 --> 00:30:27,958
答えは こんな僕の心まで 馬鹿にしないで
What is the answer? Don't make a mockery of even a heart like mine

242
00:30:28,278 --> 00:30:30,598
つないで
connecting us—

243
00:30:45,478 --> 00:30:52,918
灰色の街が嗤ってる もう足取りも重くなる
The ashen city is sneering, and my steps are already growing heavier

244
00:30:55,518 --> 00:31:01,518
声を枯らして 叫んで 足掻いて 裸足で走り続けて
Hoarsening my voice, screaming and thrashing, I kept running barefoot

245
00:31:02,318 --> 00:31:11,118
変わらないように 諦めないように 連ね綴るだけだ
So that I won't change, so that I won't give up, I simply string and spell out words

246
00:31:17,018 --> 00:31:23,218
見えているの 僕が 僕のこの声が聞こえてる？
Can you see me? Can you hear this voice of mine?

247
00:31:27,978 --> 00:31:34,178
シルエットすらも透明で きっと不格好だけれど でも せめて声を枯らそう 必死に縋っても
Even my silhouette is transparent and clumsy, but still, let me hoarsen my voice, clinging desperately

248
00:31:44,078 --> 00:31:46,478
伝えたい
I want to convey it

249
00:32:07,078 --> 00:32:09,278
最後の曲も盛り上がっていきましょう！
Let's keep the excitement going for our final song!

250
00:32:23,378 --> 00:32:30,578
あの黄昏も 折り畳めば静寂 僕らの街じゃ
Even that twilight, if folded up, is silence; in our town,

251
00:32:31,378 --> 00:32:44,978
灯を消して はじめよう 幕よ開け 見上げ願いを あなたのように 変わらず在っていたい
Turn off the lights, let's begin, raise the curtain; looking up, I want to remain unchanged just like you

252
00:32:46,578 --> 00:32:53,778
きらめきのヴェールを 目元に箒星 描いて
Drawing a veil of sparkle and a comet across my eyes

253
00:32:54,778 --> 00:33:00,778
瞬いた ソワレ 今だ 寝息を立てる太陽の目を盗んで 大脱走さ 逃げ出そうぜ
Twinkling soirée, now! Stealing away from the sleeping sun, it's a grand breakout, let's run away

254
00:33:04,778 --> 00:33:10,278
朝未き空を跨ぐ 栞を挟んだら
Crossing the dim morning sky, if we insert a bookmark

255
00:33:10,978 --> 00:33:17,178
行かなくちゃ ソワレ 夜が明けるまでさ もうすこし このままで
We must go, soirée, until dawn breaks, just a little longer like this

256
00:33:30,178 --> 00:33:34,778
あの鐘の音は 茜差したって止まない
That bell's sound won't stop even as the madder glow shines

257
00:33:34,978 --> 00:33:41,378
時間だ 集まろう 野望に喝采 エールを
It's time, let's gather, giving cheers and applause to our ambitions

258
00:33:41,978 --> 00:33:45,178
未来の話を 寂しそうに聞いてる君に
To you, listening so lonely as we talk about the future

259
00:33:45,978 --> 00:33:52,378
誓うよ 世界に魔法がなくたって 夢は続いていく
I swear, even if the world has no magic, the dream will go on

260
00:33:56,978 --> 00:34:02,578
おやすみに代わるよう 鳴りやまないメロディー 届けて
To replace 'goodnight', deliver a melody that never stops ringing

261
00:34:03,278 --> 00:34:10,278
見逃すな ソワレ 僕ら目撃者だ
Don't miss it, soirée, we are the witnesses

262
00:34:10,678 --> 00:34:17,278
蒼穹に手を伸ばした 水平線がうたた寝したって とめどなく日々を繋ぐ 架け橋 渡ったら
Reaching out to the azure sky, even if the horizon doats to sleep, crossing the bridge that endlessly connects our days

263
00:34:17,978 --> 00:34:24,278
いつの日か ソワレ 君に届くまでさ 何度でも 呼び声を
Someday, soirée, until it reaches you, no matter how many times I'll call out

264
00:34:27,978 --> 00:34:30,678
消えない軌跡 辿って
Tracing the unfading trajectory

265
00:34:33,278 --> 00:34:40,278
幾星霜の果てへ どこまでも
To the ends of ages, no matter how far

266
00:34:49,178 --> 00:34:55,278
一晩じゃ語り尽くせない悲劇も
Even tragedies too vast to tell in a single night

267
00:34:55,678 --> 00:35:00,678
一晩中 語り明かせたら 喜劇になってゆく
if we talk through them all night long, they turn into comedy.

268
00:35:01,356 --> 00:35:02,966
あ、そのあと、あのTwitterにも載せるから
Oh, and after that, I'm going to post it on Twitter too,

269
00:35:02,966 --> 00:35:04,816
あのYouTubeのみんなもね、安心してね
so everyone on YouTube, you can rest assured.

270
00:35:04,816 --> 00:35:06,266
うん
Yeah.

271
00:35:06,266 --> 00:35:08,916
えー、名残惜しいね
Man, I'm really going to miss this.

272
00:35:08,916 --> 00:35:12,866
もうね、もう台本にはね、これで星街すいせいでしたバイバイって書いてあるんだ
The script already says, "That's all from Hoshimachi Suisei, bye-bye!"

273
00:35:12,866 --> 00:35:14,066
名残惜しいね
I'm really going to miss this.

274
00:35:14,066 --> 00:35:15,316
名残惜しい
I really am.

275
00:35:15,316 --> 00:35:19,316
え、なんか、最後にさ、言ってほしい言葉とかある？
Uh, is there anything you want me to say at the very end?

276
00:35:19,316 --> 00:35:20,716
わかりました
Understood.

277
00:35:20,716 --> 00:35:21,616
それでは
Well then...

278
00:35:21,616 --> 00:35:23,116
あ、バッチコーイ！
Oh, bring it on!

279
00:35:23,116 --> 00:35:25,716
バッチコーイ！
Bring it on!

280
00:35:25,716 --> 00:35:26,816
あと、あと、は？
What else? What else?

281
00:35:26,816 --> 00:35:31,716
え？うーん...
Uh... hmm...

282
00:35:31,716 --> 00:35:36,216
ゾンビゾンビゾンビ！
Zombie, zombie, zombie!

283
00:35:36,216 --> 00:35:36,666
ゾンビゾンビゾンビ！
Zombie, zombie, zombie!

284
00:35:36,666 --> 00:35:37,416
ゾンビゾンビゾンビ！
Zombie, zombie, zombie!

285
00:35:37,416 --> 00:35:38,316
ゾンビゾンビゾンビ！
Zombie, zombie, zombie!

286
00:35:38,316 --> 00:35:39,466
また！ゾンビゾンビゾンビ！
Again! Zombie, zombie, zombie!

287
00:35:39,466 --> 00:35:40,366
ゾンビゾンビゾンビ！
Zombie, zombie, zombie!

288
00:35:40,366 --> 00:35:41,316
ゾンビゾンビゾンビ！
Zombie, zombie, zombie!

289
00:35:41,316 --> 00:35:42,516
ラスト！ゾンビゾンビゾンビ！
Last one! Zombie, zombie, zombie!

290
00:35:42,516 --> 00:35:46,066
ありがとう！
Thank you!

291
00:35:46,066 --> 00:35:48,716
このあともミュージックビデオ見てくださいね
Please keep watching the music video afterwards too, okay?

292
00:35:48,716 --> 00:35:51,316
それでは星街すいせいでした！バイバーイ！
That's all from Hoshimachi Suisei! Bye-bye!

293
00:38:57,316 --> 00:38:59,816
